Interactively pick a column from a filterable list and output its ID.

Designed for command chaining with other paso commands.

Examples:
  # Pick a column to move a task to
  paso task move -i 42 $(paso column pick)

  # Pick from a specific project
  paso column pick 2

Usage:
  paso column pick [project-id] [flags]

Flags:
  -p, --project int   Project ID (uses git branch association if not specified)
